            {
              "id": "launchdarkly-2",
              "definition": {
                "type": "note",
                "content": "**LaunchDarkly** manages feature flags: who sees which feature, in which environment. This dashboard shows its change history (events of source `launchdarkly`, tagged `env`, `project`, `flag` and `kind`), so a flag turned on can be lined up with the errors and latency that followed.\n\nConnect an account in [Integrations → LaunchDarkly](/integrations/connectors/launchdarkly) with a Reader token.",
                "background": "white",
                "align": "left",
                "fontSize": "sm"
              },
              "layout": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 0,
                "w": 12,
                "h": 4
              }
